Ted,


On May 13, 2008, at 2:18 PM, Ted wrote:

> Thanks for your email.  I tried your code for isegments and it's  
> equally slow as in uses ilines.  Using segments in the R graphics  
> package is quite efficient as it take bascially 2 pairs of points  
> and draws a line between them.  For my plot all the lines are drawn  
> quite fast, but if I use any thing related to ilines, it takes  
> forever because it has to generate a new plot over the current plot  
