#define H_OUT  1
#define H_EXIT 2

static int default_hooks = H_OUT|H_EXIT;

You want it to be 0 (no hooks). H_OUT  is the output stream hook,  
H_EXIT is the exit hook (System.exit(..)).

I meant for it to be configurable from R, but never got around to  
really do that ... I should probably disable the hooks by default on  
Windows.

